        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset A, Abbey Bell Knobset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nExquisitely versatile, the Abbey Door Knob is right at home in almost any style decor. This decorative Bell Knob made by Kwikset is proportioned to fit the palm of the hand. It will fit most pre-drilled doors. For 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch thick doors with an adjustable backset for easy installation. Available in half dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p><b>Features</b> of the Traditional Kwikset Abbey Door Knob Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pick 6 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Kwikset Abbey Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-17/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> An inactive knob for use as a pull or to match trim. This non-operational knob is for one side of the door. Complete Set - 1 knob and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Turnbutton on interior knob engages privacy lock on both knobs; emergency release hole is on exterior knob. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the knob from the interior. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Abbey Door Knob Set, Kwikset A",
                "description": "Kwikset A, Abbey Door Knob Set - Exquisitely versatile, the Abbey Door Knob is right at home in almost any style decor. This decorative Bell Knob made by Kwikset is proportioned to fit the palm of the hand. It will fit all pre-drilled doors. For 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch thick doors with an adjustable backset for easy installation. Available in half dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry functions.",
